{
  "summary": "The experiment tested multimodal fusion using PCA (n=2000) and ResNet50 encoders with concatenation aggregation. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest a baseline performance for this configuration, though the contribution of fusion versus individual modalities remains unclear. Without comparative evidence, the observed performance reflects an initial observation rather than a definitive effect of the design choices."
}

